  "body": "## What's new in v2.5.24-dev.9-alpha3\n\n- ci: the migration check reported every file as missing (pipefail + SIGPIPE)\n- ci: a release must serve both the old and the new layout, or it fails\n- api: a device mid-migration must see the image update too\n- os-update: write the never-remove-the-migration contract where it will be read\n- ci: refuse to publish a release that lost the A/B migration\n- api: show the image update on the three update cards, not just in the API\n- iso: install the A/B layout straight from the medium, with no network at all\n- ext: keep 'apt install' as the command people already know\n- ext: talk to the terminal, and do not let a killed run lock the command out\n",
